Ngeneric:Invisible-Pin|pin@5||-21|14|||||SIM_spice_card(D5G1;)S["* ---- 6T SRAM cell test: write0, read0, write1, read1, write0 ----",* MODEL LINE: use exactly the same model include/lib line that worked for,"* your full adder (look in that .spi file), for example:",.include ./tsmc018.lib,* (or: .lib ./tsmc018.lib tt   <- use whatever section name your file has),* Supply,Vsup vdd 0 1.8,* Bit-line capacitance (stands in for a column of cells),Cbl  bl  0 200f,Cblb blb 0 200f,* Switch models: precharge (to VDD) and write pull-down (to GND),.model swpc sw(vt=0.9 vh=0.1 ron=500 roff=1e12),.model swwr sw(vt=0.9 vh=0.1 ron=1k  roff=1e12),* Precharge switches (both bit lines to VDD when pc is high),Spcbl  vdd bl  pc 0 swpc,Spcblb vdd blb pc 0 swpc,* Write pull-down switches (pull one bit line low when its enable is high),Swbl  bl  0 wrbl  0 swwr,Swblb blb 0 wrblb 0 swwr,* Control waveforms,Vpc    pc    0 PWL(0 1.8 1n 1.8 1.1n 0 3.8n 0 3.9n 1.8 7n 1.8 7.1n 0 10.5n 0 10.6n 1.8 13n 1.8 13.1n 0 16.5n 0 16.6n 1.8 19n 1.8 19.1n 0 22.5n 0 22.6n 1.8 25n 1.8 25.1n 0 28.5n 0 28.6n 1.8 32n 1.8),Vwl    wl    0 PWL(0 0 1.5n 0 1.6n 1.8 3.5n 1.8 3.6n 0 7.5n 0 7.6n 1.8 10n 1.8 10.1n 0 13.5n 0 13.6n 1.8 15.5n 1.8 15.6n 0 19.5n 0 19.6n 1.8 22n 1.8 22.1n 0 25.5n 0 25.6n 1.8 27.5n 1.8 27.6n 0 32n 0),Vwrbl  wrbl  0 PWL(0 0 1.3n 0 1.4n 1.8 3.7n 1.8 3.8n 0 25.3n 0 25.4n 1.8 28n 1.8 28.1n 0 32n 0),Vwrblb wrblb 0 PWL(0 0 13.3n 0 13.4n 1.8 16n 1.8 16.1n 0 32n 0),* Timeline (ns):,*  1.3-3.7   initial write 0   (forces the cell to a known state),"*  7.5-10    read 0            (BL should dip, cell must NOT flip)",*  13.4-16   write 1           (BLB pulled low),*  19.5-22   read 1            (BLB should dip),*  25.4-28   write 0           (BL pulled low),.tran 10p 32n,* Measurements: bit-line voltages at the end of each read,.meas tran bl_read0  find v(bl)  at=9.9n,.meas tran blb_read0 find v(blb) at=9.9n,.meas tran bl_read1  find v(bl)  at=21.9n,.meas tran blb_read1 find v(blb) at=21.9n,"* Charge drawn from the supply during each write (energy = 1.8 * |charge|)",.meas tran q_write1 integ i(Vsup) from=13.3n to=16n,.meas tran q_write0 integ i(Vsup) from=25.3n to=28n,.control,run,plot v(bl) v(blb) v(wl),.endc]
